abstract: >-
  Record of a closed exploratory study of namespace interference in language models, built on seven
  systems of the 3char dataset: frozen protocol, raw responses of three models, the pre-registered
  scorer, a post hoc audit with a three-dimension evaluator, a negative result and the decision to close.
